0..75 Comment "// A constructor standing where a body ends takes the type the body answers"
76..145 Comment "// even when the result is written as a definition\'s application: the"
146..220 Comment "// lowering reads the decode through the definition\'s body, as the checker"
221..296 Comment "// unfolds it. `Maybe` is the one `data-maybe.gandr` declares. Before #2112"
297..343 Comment "// such a constructor dropped its declaration."
